<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Uriz et al. (2003) & Aizenberg et al. (2005) sponge spicule silicatein axial symmetry, concentric biosilica lamination, and Euplectella checkerboard lattice mechanics (Euplectella aspergillum (Hexactinellida) & Tethya aurantia / Pachastrella monilifera (Demospongiae) / Sycon raphanus (Calcarea))",
        "Uriz et al. (2003) & Aizenberg et al. (2005) sponge spicule silicatein axial symmetry, concentric biosilica lamination, and Euplectella checkerboard lattice mechanics faithfully reproduces Euplectella aspergillum (Hexactinellida) & Tethya aurantia / Pachastrella monilifera (Demospongiae) / Sycon raphanus (Calcarea) morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-2>,
