        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-sponge-spicule-hexactin-audit-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-3> ;
    pk:hypothesisType "3D Crystallographic Silicatein Ray Vector Symmetry (Cubic O_h 6-Ray Hexactins at theta = 90 deg vs Tetrahedral T_d 4-Ray Tetractins at cos theta = -1/3 = 109.47 deg), Concentric Lamellar Thinning (h_n prop r_n^-1) & Checkerboard Diagonal Lattice Shear Stiffness" ;
    pk:weightOfEvidence 4.87e-01 .

