<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bavestrello-sponge-spicule-hexactin-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Uriz et al. (2003) & Aizenberg et al. (2005) sponge spicule silicatein axial symmetry, concentric biosilica lamination, and Euplectella checkerboard lattice mechanics — Code-to-model traceability: 62/100" ;
